      "items": [
        "India hosts 42 UNESCO World Heritage Sites, categorized into cultural, natural, and mixed heritage locations.",
        "The Swadesh Darshan Scheme drives integrated, theme-based tourist circuit development across the country.",
        "The PRASHAD initiative aims at holistic infrastructure development around major national pilgrimage and heritage sites.",
        "Eco-tourism and sustainable travel center largely around National Parks, Wildlife Sanctuaries, and Ramsar Wetland sites.",
